h4. Bulk update requests

A bulk update request (BUR) proposes changes to the tag vocabulary: aliases, implications, renames, mass edits. Write the request as a script, one change per line:

[code]
alias old_spelling -> new_spelling
imply cat_ears -> animal_ears
mass update old_tag -> new_tag
[/code]

A Builder or above reviews it. When approved, every line is applied and every affected post is edited. Requests are the record of why the vocabulary is the way it is.

The forum, where upstream discusses these, is not part of this site. Discuss a request on Matrix.
